{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_027say_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_8000_situation", "source_sha256": "df7e905582089f19789355d95376536c02e33291bec3890e35ab61b7a6d69c3a", "ja": "グラビアのお仕事　撮影前", "zh": "写真拍摄工作　拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_027say_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_8000_place", "source_sha256": "67daf0c26147fd376f1ce37c954b59a14176b42939c434fb4ed9a17050c86dff", "ja": "バー店内", "zh": "酒吧店内", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_027say_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_8001_p", "source_sha256": "69a282f1e74208b675495e40499927056c7846963123c9ca2289ec5b10cc0c61", "ja": "（アイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア企画撮影。\n紗代子のバーテンダー姿は板についている！）", "zh": "（偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真企划拍摄。\n纱代子的酒保装扮十分合身！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_027say_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_8002_027say", "source_sha256": "431f6c79c037da6f72548311e5dd16e13c9a83b75ee6b7d43dc0c66fd5e45b83", "ja": "自分でも驚いたんですけど……\nこの衣装、とても馴染んでいる気がします。", "zh": "连我自己都很惊讶……我觉得这身服装似乎非常适合我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_027say_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_8003_027say", "source_sha256": "0727153477d8f3de8c4514ec9b791bf2421f216031122281f31ce91946d0b213", "ja": "{$P$}の目にも、\n同じように見えてるといいんですけど……。", "zh": "在{$P$}眼里，\n要是也能看起来是一样的话就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_027say_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_8004_p", "source_sha256": "97ebc9cdb2a1a0af6af21133540bfc3e0dd088a16aee7bca8dee4e14cf49c1dd", "ja": "ああ、バッチリだ！　紗代子みたいなバーテンダーが\nいたら、毎日でも通いたくなるかもな。", "zh": "啊，特别棒！要是有像纱代子这样的调酒师，我可能每天都想去光顾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_027say_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_8005_027say", "source_sha256": "8502cff118ce97e35640a3a1756c11743255d149c1ec14ed65bf096e0505d833", "ja": "本当ですか！？　それなら、{$P$}は\nどんな接客をされたら嬉しいですか？", "zh": "真的吗！？那要是{$P$}先生，会希望受到怎样的待客服务呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_027say_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_8006", "source_sha256": "3903f6e2585e722a2c65c84ea7d96a7822945c8f72fbb89a7e4c2146b184b764", "ja": "フレンドリーに", "zh": "亲切地", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_027say_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_8007", "source_sha256": "52425454c7dfade315c6cb5b291357175ae9f8bf5c30290763365cea333740b2", "ja": "つかずはなれず", "zh": "不即不离", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_027say_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_8008", "source_sha256": "5e8a98e274a36dd9dcbb17310aaa8f44edbbf74fe0323c1db3c318b42dd27cc8", "ja": "叱ってくれる", "zh": "会训斥自己", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_027say_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_8100_p", "source_sha256": "524917a119cdcb4b65162db9e460eb260413c64aa4befbf39766d72e120ca9b9", "ja": "そのままの紗代子でいいんじゃないかな。\n気さくに接してくれる感じが、心地いいというか。", "zh": "就这样做原本的纱代子，不也挺好的吗？  \n她那种亲切随和地与人相处的感觉，让人觉得很舒服，怎么说呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_027say_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_8101_027say", "source_sha256": "806168a222d0dfb77b0cb2d162382a8125d448d24fd61fd5f734a6d45647fb27", "ja": "……友達みたいな感覚で、ってことでしょうか？\nそういうことなら、うまくできるかもしれません！", "zh": "……意思是像朋友一样的感觉吗？\n如果是这样的话，我或许能做好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_027say_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_8102_027say", "source_sha256": "5a7113bcc0ee1d88ff1254e5112a27d39b7854ad23fd6dbcb6f025cfbdddb72e", "ja": "お客さんと一緒に笑って、一緒に泣いて……\n人生のカンフル剤になれるように頑張ります♪", "zh": "和客人一起欢笑，一起哭泣……  \n为了成为人生的强心针，我会努力的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_027say_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_8200_p", "source_sha256": "bed3b8661cd074bf2db0ea6eadf862f0a7cbde2fd36e17c28b8ae4046ef6283b", "ja": "適度に接客してくれる方がいい時もあるな。\n一人でじっくり飲みたい人もいると思うんだ。", "zh": "有时候，适度地招待客人也挺好的。\n我想也有人想一个人静静地喝酒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_027say_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_8201_027say", "source_sha256": "33fecc70f86517a26dc9bde996c588c2393a63aea7c5c9b7b7be4e877c77df13", "ja": "なるほど。適度に、って部分が大事ですね。\nタイミングとか、ちゃんと見てないと。", "zh": "原来如此。“适度”这一点很重要呢。\n不注意观察时机可不行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_027say_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_8202_027say", "source_sha256": "5e9b8f0389f4bba5b3ccb5a4b5daf688efd2268ae0a7362e4ead9b1bb44bff17", "ja": "観察力が試される接客……やりがいがありそうです！\nふふっ、燃えてきたぞ～！！", "zh": "考验观察力的待客之道……感觉很有挑战性！\n嘿嘿，我燃起来了——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_027say_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_8300_p", "source_sha256": "ae5fee9f46ffe146f345fa8d307039e1eeeb1d83490c8bf76f4bc93c20c58e46", "ja": "相手を叱ったり、たしなめてくれるような……\nそんな存在であってほしいなぁ。", "zh": "希望对方能训斥我、提醒我注意分寸……成为那样的存在就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_027say_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_8301_027say", "source_sha256": "f80ea4960c2116aded8c1560e31ea085a86d50bd655c064010308a2030e13343", "ja": "え？　それってバーテンダーさんに求めること\nなんですかね？　うーん……。", "zh": "诶？这就是对酒保的要求吗？嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_027say_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_8302_027say", "source_sha256": "a3af7e706af66f44be3631d45dafd4a15b6f4778d8ea77ef4fe6f18ac7fb24c1", "ja": "私のバーテンダー像がぼやけてきました……。\nすみません！　聞かなかったことにします……！", "zh": "我的酒保形象越来越模糊了……\n对不起！就当我没问过吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
